{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"266","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Queue at the School"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"During the break the schoolchildren, boys and girls, formed a queue of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" people in the canteen. Initially the children stood in the order they entered the canteen. However, after a while the boys started feeling awkward for standing in front of the girls in the queue and they started letting the girls move forward each second. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's describe the process more precisely. Let's say that the positions in the queue are sequentially numbered by integers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", at that the person in the position number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is served first. Then, if at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" a boy stands on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th position and a girl stands on the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i + 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th position, then at time "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th position will have a girl and the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(i + 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th position will have a boy. The time is given in seconds."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You've got the initial position of the children, at the initial moment of time. Determine the way the queue is going to look after "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n, t ≤ 50)"},{"kind":"text","text":", which represent the number of children in the queue and the time after which the queue will transform into the arrangement you need to find. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":", which represents the schoolchildren's initial arrangement. If the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th position in the queue contains a boy, then the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character of string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", otherwise the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character equals \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":", which describes the arrangement after "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds. If the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th position has a boy after the needed time, then the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th character "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" must equal \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", otherwise it must equal \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 1\nBGGBG\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"GBGGB\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 2\nBGGBG\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"GGBGB\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 1\nGGGB\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"GGGB\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"266B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/266/problem/B"}